{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T22:39:21+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stumble Guys", "steam_appid": 1677740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/955591fc4f00dc02668da8ff278508e5.poster.avif?t=1784624338\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/955591fc4f00dc02668da8ff278508e5.webm?t=1784624338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/955591fc4f00dc02668da8ff278508e5.mp4?t=1784624338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUMP INTO THE CHAOS – PLAY FOR FREE! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and dive into the ultimate multiplayer party battle royale! Race, stumble, and battle it out in hilarious obstacle courses where only one player can become the winner - will it be you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>32-PLAYER MULTIPLAYER ONLINE MADNESS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against up to 32 players in fast-paced, chaotic matches and tournaments. Can you dodge, jump, and stumble your way to victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/21c1dff8383138f8c13de07b4e9a4da1.poster.avif?t=1784624338\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/21c1dff8383138f8c13de07b4e9a4da1.webm?t=1784624338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/21c1dff8383138f8c13de07b4e9a4da1.mp4?t=1784624338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY TOURNAMENTS &amp; CLIMB THE RANKED LEADERBOARD </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, clash, kick and fall to survive in tournaments and collect points to climb the Ranked leaderboard and unlock cool rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ COOL MAPS, ENDLESS FUN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed through insane obstacle courses, dodge crazy traps, and outplay your rivals! With over 60 maps packed with challenges, every match is a new adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR STUMBLER – THOUSANDS OF COSMETICS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock epic skins, hilarious emotes, and more to stand out from the crowd. Become a ninja, superhero, or even a chicken, there’s a style for everyone. Collect them all and show them off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/12daac30d542a385761fb236ff2c99d1.poster.avif?t=1784624338\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/12daac30d542a385761fb236ff2c99d1.webm?t=1784624338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/12daac30d542a385761fb236ff2c99d1.mp4?t=1784624338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIMITED-TIME EVENTS &amp; AWESOME CROSSOVERS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into special events playing the best game modes like Floor is Lava and Banana Bonanza or expand your collection with legendary stumblers from SpongeBob, My Hero Academia, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROSS-PLAY ON STEAM &amp; MOBILE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play anywhere, anytime! Stumble Guys is free to play and supports cross-play between Steam and mobile, so you can battle your friends no matter where they are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to stumble? Download now and join the fun!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/955591fc4f00dc02668da8ff278508e5.poster.avif?t=1784624338\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/955591fc4f00dc02668da8ff278508e5.webm?t=1784624338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/955591fc4f00dc02668da8ff278508e5.mp4?t=1784624338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUMP INTO THE CHAOS – PLAY FOR FREE! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and dive into the ultimate multiplayer party battle royale! Race, stumble, and battle it out in hilarious obstacle courses where only one player can become the winner - will it be you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>32-PLAYER MULTIPLAYER ONLINE MADNESS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against up to 32 players in fast-paced, chaotic matches and tournaments. Can you dodge, jump, and stumble your way to victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/21c1dff8383138f8c13de07b4e9a4da1.poster.avif?t=1784624338\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/21c1dff8383138f8c13de07b4e9a4da1.webm?t=1784624338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/21c1dff8383138f8c13de07b4e9a4da1.mp4?t=1784624338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY TOURNAMENTS &amp; CLIMB THE RANKED LEADERBOARD </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, clash, kick and fall to survive in tournaments and collect points to climb the Ranked leaderboard and unlock cool rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ COOL MAPS, ENDLESS FUN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed through insane obstacle courses, dodge crazy traps, and outplay your rivals! With over 60 maps packed with challenges, every match is a new adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR STUMBLER – THOUSANDS OF COSMETICS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock epic skins, hilarious emotes, and more to stand out from the crowd. Become a ninja, superhero, or even a chicken, there’s a style for everyone. Collect them all and show them off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/12daac30d542a385761fb236ff2c99d1.poster.avif?t=1784624338\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/12daac30d542a385761fb236ff2c99d1.webm?t=1784624338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/12daac30d542a385761fb236ff2c99d1.mp4?t=1784624338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIMITED-TIME EVENTS &amp; AWESOME CROSSOVERS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into special events playing the best game modes like Floor is Lava and Banana Bonanza or expand your collection with legendary stumblers from SpongeBob, My Hero Academia, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROSS-PLAY ON STEAM &amp; MOBILE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play anywhere, anytime! Stumble Guys is free to play and supports cross-play between Steam and mobile, so you can battle your friends no matter where they are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to stumble? Download now and join the fun!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Ready for the chaos? Stumble Guys is a 32-player, fast-paced multiplayer party royale where players dash, jump, and fall across hilarious obstacle courses in a fun race to be the last one standing.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Indonesian, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/header.jpg?t=1784624338", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784624338", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784624338", "website": "https://www.scopely.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8400 | AMD Phenom II X4 965<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon HD 7750 | NVIDIA Geforce GTX 260<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor 